{"type":"message","id":"04907bf8","parentId":"dd877d33","timestamp":"2026-04-11T01:29:58.143Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Captain wants the report in pure text infographic format - no markdown tables, no code blocks. Just plain text with visual elements like box-drawing characters, ASCII art, etc. Discord/WhatsApp friendly format.\n\nLet me create a clean, visually appealing text-only version of the report.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_hn5siknwm7rm_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"feishu","message":"📊 李小军·缠论模拟交易日报\n🗓️ 2026-04-11 周六\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n【持仓一览】\n  A50  �_LONG_  ×25手\n  开仓价：100 | 当前：≈101.05\n  浮盈：+26.25 (+1.05%)\n  止损：95 | 目标：110\n\n  账户净值：$9,876\n  可用资金：$7,350\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n【缠论结构】三级别联立分析\n\n▶ 日线 → 定方向\n  3900-3920强支撑确认\n  下跌一笔力度衰减 ✅ 背驰信号\n  → 当前：日线一笔反弹中\n\n▶ 30分钟 → 找结构\n  中枢区间：3890—3950\n  当前：向上离开中枢\n  → 3950突破回抽不破 = 三买\n\n▶ 5分钟 → 精确入场\n  向上线段未完成\n  守住100.5 → 延续\n  跌破99.5  → 减仓信号 ⚠️\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n【背驰判断】✅ 已确认\n日线一笔内部30分钟\n出现盘整背驰\n→ 反弹延续概率较高\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n【操作计划】\n\n  A50  → 持仓不动，100.5上方续持\n  GOLD → 观望，突破$4850再关注\n  BTC  → 观望，突破$75000再关注\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n【风险监控】\n\n  恐惧贪婪：11 极度恐惧\n  地缘风险：以黎谈判进行中\n  止损位  ：95（-5%）\n  账户上限：15%\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n> \"走势终完美，当前处于下跌\n> 完成后的反弹阶段，\n> 需等待二买确认。\"\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🦞 李小军·简约缠论 | 每日08:00推送\n⚠️ 仅供参考，不构成投资建议","target":"user:ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"auto","usage":{"input":33469,"output":622,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34091,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775870981584}}
